Cell["\<\
Both inner and outer products has precedence over geometric product, i.e. \
\[DoubleStruckE][2]\[GeometricProduct]\[DoubleStruckE][1]\[InnerProduct]\
\[DoubleStruckE][1]=\[DoubleStruckE][2]\[GeometricProduct](\[DoubleStruckE][1]\
\[InnerProduct]\[DoubleStruckE][1]) and  \[DoubleStruckE][2]\
\[GeometricProduct]\[DoubleStruckE][1]\[OuterProduct]\[DoubleStruckE][2]=\
\[DoubleStruckE][2]\[GeometricProduct](\[DoubleStruckE][1]\[OuterProduct]\
\[DoubleStruckE][2]),\
\>", "Text",
