   3.7699247523568497`*^9}, {3.769924802488009*^9, 3.769924810517736*^9}, {
   3.7766723538406487`*^9, 3.776672361051865*^9}, {3.937725842338475*^9, 
   3.93772586172803*^9}, 
   3.939808316604836*^9},ExpressionUUID->"5ff1d83b-8149-40bc-8d32-\
139f7346c65e"],

Cell["\<\
Recently we included possibility to work with Clifford algebras over \
noncommutative field (ring).  This is highly experimental feature. Only  \
basis operations are supported (products, grade, component selection, etc.) \
We only tested these operations with Quaternionic field, though in principle \
any other Clifford algebra can be used as a coefficient algebra. We assume \
that coefficient field  elements are multiplied by geometric product only (no \
other noncommutative products are  defined for coefficient elements) and that \
main Clifford algebra elements always commute with coefficient algebra \
elements. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.531215444705543*^9, 3.531215453183996*^9}, {
   3.531215728886285*^9, 3.531215752489262*^9}, {3.531215819529191*^9, 
